{"study_accession":"PRJNA454694","secondary_study_accession":"SRP144363","title":"Sequencing based maternal whole blood expression changes with gestational age and labor in normal pregnancy","description":"Maternal plasama colected longitudinally were profiled using paired-end Illumina RNA-Seq with globin reduction to evaluate changes with gestational age and with labor in normal pregnancy. Overall design: The study included normal pregnancies with (n=8) and without (n=8) spontaneous labor at term. Half of the women in each group had 3 longitudinal samples taken from 12.1-40.3 weeks of gestation, while the other half of women had only one sample taken at term before delivery, for a total of 32 samples.","pubmed":"30696862;34195686","geo_series":"","n_samples":32,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN09011902","study_accession":"PRJNA454694","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"Sample_7 [RNA-seq]","description":"Sample_7 [RNA-seq]","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM3124818","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":2,"first_public":"2019-02-09","attributes":[["source_name","Maternal Blood"],["individual","mi058"],["group","TIL [Term in Labor (with labor)]"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR7094310","experiment_accession":"SRX4022891","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2500","read_count":32549877,"base_count":6423727674,"first_public":"2019-02-09","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM3124818: Sample_7 [RNA-seq] Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"},{"run_accession":"SRR7094311","experiment_accession":"SRX4022891","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2500","read_count":34069649,"base_count":6724316836,"first_public":"2019-02-09","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM3124818: Sample_7 [RNA-seq] Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMN09011903","study_accession":"PRJNA454694","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample"